OL,3,GNEWSAEye donation 'an enormous gift',
OL,4,Asays recipient
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man whose sight was saved by donated
OL,7,Fcorneas has urged people to consider
OL,8,Feye donation after death, describing it
OL,9,Fas "an enormous gift".
OL,11,FCornea transplants can restore vision
OL,12,Fto people with partial or total
OL,13,Fblindness caused by some conditions.
OL,14,FThere are currently about 6,000 people
OL,15,Fon the waiting list across the UK,
OL,16,Fincluding 50 in Gloucestershire.
OL,18,FJustin Head received a transplant 18
OL,19,Fmonths ago after being diagnosed with a
OL,20,Frare condition that can cause
OL,21,Fblindness.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
